    <statement><p>Given the function <m>f(x)=\displaystyle\frac{1}{x+9}</m>, calculate the
following values:</p>
<p><m>f(a)=</m> <fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p><m>f(a+h)=</m> <fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
<p><m>\frac{f(a+h)-f(a)}{h}=</m> <fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0003"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{1}{a+9}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{1}{a+h+9}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{\frac{1}{a+h+9}-\frac{1}{a+9}}{h}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
